  <article class="container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="tag">VPN</span>
      <h1>NordVPN vs Surfshark: Best VPN for Privacy and Streaming 2026</h1>
      <p class="meta">Updated July 2026</p>
    </header>

    <p class="lead">
      NordVPN and Surfshark are the two VPNs most users shortlist for privacy and streaming in 2026, and they are not interchangeable. NordVPN wins on speed, server count, and polished apps. Surfshark wins on price, unlimited device connections, and strong value for families. This comparison breaks down speed, servers, streaming, privacy, pricing, and apps so you can pick the right one for your needs.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-top">
      <a href="https://nordvpn.com" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Try NordVPN</a>
      <a href="https://surfshark.com" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Try Surfshark</a>
    </div>

    <h2>Quick Comparison</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <tr><th>Feature</th><th>NordVPN</th><th>Surfshark</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Best For</td><td>Speed, streaming, power users</td><td>Budget, families, multi-device</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$3.09/mo (24-month plan)</td><td>$2.19/mo (24-month plan)</td></tr>
